# Build context: app/worker
#
# An allow-list, not a deny-list. The previous version of this file excluded bin/ and
# obj/ by name, which was correct but incomplete: obj/ was still committed to Git and
# still carried another developer's absolute paths and an unrelated commit hash. See
# docs/arch/application.md, defect D7.
#
# Excluding obj/ here also matters for correctness, not only for size. A stale
# obj/project.assets.json in the context makes "dotnet restore" resolve against a
# cache that does not exist in the build stage, which fails in a confusing way.
#
# Maintenance rule: a new file or directory that the image needs must be added here
# in the same commit.

*

!Dockerfile
!Worker.csproj
!Program.cs
